    "title": "The Store Next Door",
    "body": "The cursed storefront on the other side of Bob's Burgers, perpetually **FOR LEASE**.\n\n## The gag\nEvery episode's opening credits shows a different doomed business setting up shop here — pest control, yarn stores, crematorium supply outlets — before it inevitably fails and the sign goes back up.\n\n## Notes\n- Blink-and-you-miss-it store names are one of the show's longest-running jokes\n- Nothing survives here. Nothing."
